ps":{},"children":["07"]},"「自己都合による自主退職」にはサインしないでください。一度サインしてしまうと、解雇予告手当（N）がもらえなくなります"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/19-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"退職前に、給与明細、勤怠記録、労働契約書、社会保険の記録、およびチャットの履歴を保存しておきましょう"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/19-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"粉塵、騒音、化学物質を扱う業務に就く前に、契約書に危害に関する記載があるか確認しましょう。3回の職業健康診断は会社が手配し、費用を負担します"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/19-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"粉塵、騒音、化学毒物による損傷は不可逆：防護具は会社が提供しなければならず、防護措置のない作業は拒否できる"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/19-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"仕事中の負傷や通勤中の交通事故、まず最初に行うべきは労災認定。会社が申請しない場合は自分で申請できる"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/19-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"「出勤した時点で労災」を信じないで：急な体調不良時は、まず 120 へ。打刻のために急いで向かうのではなく。"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/19-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"会社が労災保険に加入していなくても、労災補償は受けられます。会社が同等の基準で全額負担します"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/19-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"症状が安定した後に労働能力鑑定を行い、障害等級を直接金額に換算する"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/19-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"労災死亡における3つの給付を明確に区別すること：葬儀補助金、扶養家族年金、一回限り労災死亡補助金"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/19-16"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"職場で長期にわたりいじめ、罵倒、嫌がらせを受けている場合、一人で耐え込まないこと：まずは証拠を残すために記録し、その性質に応じて、苦情申し立て、通報、または仲裁の手続きを進めること"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/19-17"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["17"]},"退職時には会社に離職証明書を請求すること。契約期間、退職日、職種、勤続年数を明記させること"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/19-18"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["18"]},"退職補償金を受け取る際はまず所得税を確認：現地の前年度従業員平均賃金の3倍以内は非課税、超過分は別途計算され、当年の給与とは合算されない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/19-19"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["19"]},"別の都市で働くときは、年金保険と医療保険の加入関係を新しい加入地へ移す。納付年数は累計されるので、脱退しない"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"現在地"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/book"},"children":["本を読む"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/book/19"},"children":["第19章"," ·"," ","在職、離職、および労災"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"19-03"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["03"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["エビデンス"," ","A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"ja"},"children":["試用期間には法定の上限があり、給与は 80% を下回ってはならず、かつ一度しか設定できません"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"ja","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["契約期間が 1 年以内の場合、試用期間は最大で 1 ヶ月です。1 年から 3 年の場合は最大 2 ヶ月、3 年を超える場合は最大 6 ヶ月です。同一企業での試用は一度しか認められず、本採用後に配置転換を行って再度試用期間を設けることは違法です。試用期間中の給与は、同職種の最低ランクまたは契約で定められた給与の 80% を下回ってはならず、かつ現地の最低賃金をも下回ってはなりません。"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["費用・手間"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["無料。署名する前に数分かけて、契約期間と試用期間の長さが一致しているか確認してください。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["契約期間が 3 か月以上 1 年未満の場合、試用期間は 1 か月を超えてはならない。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"記録する：試用期間には法定の上限があり、給与は 80% を下回ってはならず、かつ一度しか設定できません"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"できている"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"やることに追加"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"お気に入り"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"このヒントを共有"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"詳細を閉じる"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["費用・手間"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["無料。署名する前に数分かけて、契約期間と試用期間の長さが一致しているか確認してください。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["契約期間が 3 か月以上 1 年未満の場合、試用期間は 1 か月を超えてはならない。1 年以上 3 年未満の場合、2 か月を超えてはならない。3 年以上の契約、および終了日を定めない無期雇用契約の場合、6 か月を超えてはならない。特定の業務の完了を期限とする契約、または合計で 3 か月未満の契約においては、試用期間を定めることはできない。「同一の雇用主は同一の労働者に対し、一度しか試用期間を定めることができない」という原則に基づき、同一の会社が同一の人物に対して試用期間を設けることは一度限りである。契約書に試用期間のみが記載されている場合、その試用期間は成立せず、その期間がそのまま労働契約の期間となる。試用期間の給与は「当該事業所の同職種の最低給与額、または労働契約で定められた給与額の80%を下回ってはならず、かつ、雇用主が所在する地域の最低賃金基準を下回ってはならない」ものとします。試用期間が法定の期間を超えて設定されており、かつ実際にその期間勤務した場合は、会社は試用期間終了後の月給基準に基づき、超過した期間に対して別途補償金を支払う必要があります。試用期間中に会社が契約を解除しようとする場合は、法律に明記された特定の事由に該当する場合に限られ、かつ労働者に対してその理由を説明しなければなりません（全国共通）"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["出典"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["全国人大常委会 (2007). 劳动合同法（第十九、二十、二十一、八十三条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"http://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2007/content_711013.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["http://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2007/content_711013.htm"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"http://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2007/content_711013.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["出典を開く"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["著者の注記"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["最も一般的な3つの違法行為。第一に、契約期間を 1 年としているにもかかわらず、3 ヶ月の試用期間を定めているケース。第二に、本採用後に配置転換を行い、再度試用期間を設けるケース。第三に、「試用期間中は社会保険に加入しない」というケース。社会保険の義務は入社初日から発生し、試用期間の有無には関係ありません。雇用主側の義務については第 12 節第 16 条を参照してください。試用期間中の解雇が、即座に一銭も支払われないことを意味するわけではありません。解雇の理由が法律で認められた種類であるかを確認する必要があります。違法解雇の場合は、第 6 条に基づき 2N として計算されます。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["自分のメモ"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["自分へのメモを書く…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/ja/tip/19-02"},"